{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_003_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4ad22416dce724c76a1126257277a87a24c66e92daab080d2a90a89aa27151f5", "ja": "（今日は、海美の初公演だ。\n開演時間まで、あと少しだが……）", "zh": "（今天就是海美首次公演的日子。\n距离开演还有一点时间……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_003_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "83617300eb40d4b65c93e52a60a17ceb8153f3581cbbe797ccbc09988b3f0407", "ja": "そわそわ……そわそわ……。", "zh": "（坐不住……坐不住……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_003_1002_p", "source_sha256": "c878900f683476ecc719f4f2ec2662f1ff9b36c82adad332280883182a904110", "ja": "海美、もうすぐ開演だな。\n緊張してないか？", "zh": "海美，就快开演了。\n你会紧张吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_003_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "e63b838c3f690412732325a41ddede6e3362398c45a156cc1da2fa4a351c815b", "ja": "{$P$}！　うん、大丈夫！\nそれより私、楽しみでしょうがないんだ～☆", "zh": "{$P$}！嗯，没问题！\n比起紧张，我反而期待到不行～☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_003_1004_029umi", "source_sha256": "e9110021bdc3ec015705da240241117499dd9e59f7c06e1c936104d44b3288d6", "ja": "だって、大好きなアイドルになって、\n初めてステージに立てるんだよ！？", "zh": "因为我即将成为自己最喜欢的偶像，\n并首次站上舞台！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_003_1005_p", "source_sha256": "3c48120b3cd3d2dfad5b186945464046410ed28561acbfb61d772e6ed74c3686", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。\n今日は記念すべき、初ステージだ。", "zh": "嗯，是啊。\n今天是你首次登台表演，值得纪念呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_003_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "bf91d83154a09fd008d7879247a90eaa10e06a37394cad9ba95e529c615ded99", "ja": "歌もダンスも、まだまだ全然だけど……\nとりあえず、女子力いっぱい出さなくちゃ！", "zh": "虽然我的歌舞都还不是很好……\n但总之我会多多展现女子力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_003_1007_029umi", "source_sha256": "d2cf2506cb41bdf36fa6ccb94c02c58d58e466ffb9c2c98bc05773866bacdc8a", "ja": "そして今度こそ、このすごいポーズで\n私の体の柔らかさを……！", "zh": "然后这次我一定要用这种厉害的姿势，\n来展现身体的柔软度……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_003_1008", "source_sha256": "13bd492b9bc78938020db04cac7926dc293d6a8d78d0585cb9d839495d61203e", "ja": "やめなさい", "zh": "别这样做", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_003_2000_p", "source_sha256": "380c592f0a184b271526d23af2862ee1a261a395773b4d733521d08ab55a0612", "ja": "だから、そのポーズはやめなさい。\n早く手をしまって……いや普通にしまっていいから！", "zh": "就叫你别摆那些姿势了。\n快把手收回来……不，普通地收回来就好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_003_2001_029umi", "source_sha256": "16379f94d1842b66998b9d8113561fabbaf41a4c3c7f5496516ca94855ee1974", "ja": "あーあ。\nお客さんへのアピールになると思ったのに～。", "zh": "真可惜，\n本想对观众展现一下的说～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_003_2002_p", "source_sha256": "3f745a9884ac8cace9249649a3cf17f63c5286b24e6d03729ae11eb23b77a530", "ja": "大丈夫。そんな不思議なポーズをしなくても、\nお客さんには充分、アピールできるよ。", "zh": "没关系，就算不摆那么神奇的姿势，\n你也能充分地把自己的魅力展现给观众看的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_003_2003_029umi", "source_sha256": "dac7c279cd6df1502d821e146576e76f51c496bc85c1f4531229fde9c821c465", "ja": "わ、ホント？\nどれどれ、どのポーズで？", "zh": "哇，真的吗？\n哪个哪个，用哪个姿势？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_003_2004_p", "source_sha256": "d0acd47a1841b8a64917f0158aa722041e92373ca46027d511b61397f58cfa5d", "ja": "どれでもないって。\n海美は普通に立ってるだけで充分、魅力的なんだ。", "zh": "就说不是任何姿势了。\n海美只要普通地站着，就已经很有魅力了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_003_2005_029umi", "source_sha256": "70d75f777e27a8d02f7b0930ccd2e5c68883e2212cae2448bd70c796cf4e2d7e", "ja": "え……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_003_2006_p", "source_sha256": "1094d72a70a8b0dae57ed98435e20da9abac9c4d33869f1b4574f9078197a303", "ja": "姿勢がいいから、立ち姿も綺麗で品もいい。\nバレエ経験のおかげかな。", "zh": "因为你姿势很端正，所以站姿也很美、有气质。\n应该是多亏练过芭蕾舞吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_003_2007_029umi", "source_sha256": "c7ae2a3f882a41002ec7c2e39ba2ac62d33264c427bfbc1443798cf99f7791ca", "ja": "そ、そんな……立ってるだけで魅力的とか～。\nえへ、えへへ……えへへへ～♪", "zh": "居、居然说我……光是站着就很有魅力～\n嘿嘿，嘿嘿……嘿嘿嘿～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_003_2008_029umi", "source_sha256": "152ceaf6b6e7f3ab5f124d74cdd0a4ed64566536f504f08c5ef79b5f28b63f07", "ja": "ま、まあ、ほら、バレエの基本は姿勢だからねっ。\n教えてくれた先生も、すっごく厳しかった！", "zh": "也、也是啦，毕竟芭蕾舞的基本就是姿势端正。\n当初指导我的老师也超严格的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_003_2009_029umi", "source_sha256": "3d82048d879f9b7b0925e2ab20b395d4555631d52a631970f0c6108657408a30", "ja": "指先から爪先、頭のてっぺんにまで\n神経を行き届かせて！って、よく言われたなー。", "zh": "老师常说从手指尖到脚趾尖，\n甚至到头顶，都要用神经去感受！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_003_2010_p", "source_sha256": "3cf32f91cae728d2b7479e0bac6a39ee3ae25b8412924db76741fe725344b4e2", "ja": "そうか。そういう厳しいレッスンを経て、\n今の海美の綺麗な立ち姿があるんだな。", "zh": "这样啊。因为经历过这么严格的训练，\n海美现在才会有这么美的站姿吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_003_2011_029umi", "source_sha256": "e14c5654651a3fc49c0ad65190a8893093bfa7cf725edce728a0f298d88b39d4", "ja": "ま、またまた～。習ってる時は、\nけっこう大変だったんだけど……でもでも～。", "zh": "你、你又来了～\n虽然学舞时满辛苦的……可是可是～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_003_2012_029umi", "source_sha256": "31c4b91d715b94e3935f0e8d77b8797a2becff8cbcd71568510c6b337ab7cd31", "ja": "ずっと頑張ってたバレエが、ホントにアイドルの役に\n立ってるなら私、なんか……すっごくうれしい～っ☆", "zh": "要是我过去努力练的芭蕾舞，真的能在当偶像时\n有所帮助，感觉……会超高兴的～☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_003_2013_p", "source_sha256": "efc4989f94d7d14dad2e858dcf1fb8e5793caec4fe3433b9c1a51a02ddde2bb4", "ja": "もちろん、すごく役に立ってるよ。\nだから海美、今日は自信を持っていこう！", "zh": "那当然，会很有帮助的。\n所以说海美，你今天就带着自信上台去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_003_2014_p", "source_sha256": "0fb9d4db519422ee712b1e4b9316fade7425c9a52ba8ddc9f15f9f5fb523363a", "ja": "まだ出来ないことはたくさんあるだろうけど、\n海美にしかできないことも、たくさんある。", "zh": "虽然可能还有很多进步空间，\n但一定也有许多事，是只有海美才做得到的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_003_2015_p", "source_sha256": "beb93cbc40a2ed496f750afbbf8e445f3d09592b963d277e3b3a3d3b75b6ec99", "ja": "それに、一緒に初舞台を踏む仲間もたくさんいる。\n仲間にしかできないことも、たくさんある。", "zh": "而且你还有很多一起首次登台的伙伴。\n也有许多事，是只有伙伴才做得到的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_003_2016_029umi", "source_sha256": "409e191a7fbe452009ff47be9b463af4fa312fb543a62c323e5895315744295c", "ja": "うんっ、わかった！　みんなのたくさんを、\nみんなでステージで出して……！", "zh": "嗯，我知道了！要把大家能做的许多事，\n一起在舞台上发挥出来……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_003_2017_029umi", "source_sha256": "d6ae2848a9eb32bcc0d6bc35f94db4e2edd8bcc194b46b6bb55e6ab5a31a604b", "ja": "みんなで、すっごい初舞台にするっ☆\nもう、一生忘れられないくらいの！", "zh": "大家一起打造出超棒的首次表演☆\n而且是一生难忘的那种！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_003_2018_p", "source_sha256": "bf2c2c2f5ef523bd72f6124abde5e355541c0809d506dc1f3d0514e1cc436b1c", "ja": "ああ、きっとそうなるよ。……さあ、\nもうすぐ開演のブザーが鳴る。準備はいいか？", "zh": "嗯，一定会的……好啦，\n开演铃差不多要响起了，准备好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_003_2019_029umi", "source_sha256": "a439b5416c7510f052250ce99903e5e1e6e6c5f24f496c2736f3c2eada9ecfa0", "ja": "はーい！\n{$P$}、いってくるね！", "zh": "好了──！\n{$P$}，我走啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_003_2020_p", "source_sha256": "f1441a6050886f239ff0d993bf343e15f05e32d97f8da1b5da87e41767d37ca9", "ja": "（海美は笑顔で駆け出していく。今日のこのステージは\nきっと、大勢の人に、鮮やかな印象を与えるだろう！）", "zh": "（海美带着笑容跑了出去。今天这场表演，\n一定会让许多人留下鲜明的印象吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
